   "id": "file:langgraph/nodes/news/classifier.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "classifier.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/nodes/news/classifier.py",
   "summary": "Node 3: News Classifier — 新闻分类 + 重要性评分 职责： - 调用 LLM 对每篇文章进行分类（macro/stock/company/geopolitics/policy/technology） - 评估重要性分数（0~1） - 标记市场/行业关联 使用 prompts/news/classification.md 模板。",
   "tags": [
    "langgraph",
    "node",
    "function"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "file:langgraph/nodes/news/cleaner.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "cleaner.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/nodes/news/cleaner.py",
   "summary": "Node 1: News Cleaner — 语言检测 + 清洗 + 标准化 职责： - 检测文章语言（zh/en） - 清洗 HTML 标签、多余空白 - 计算 content_hash（SHA-256，供去重使用） - 过滤过短/无效文章",
   "tags": [
    "langgraph",
    "node",
    "function"
   ],
   "complexity": "moderate",
   "languageNotes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "file:langgraph/nodes/news/deduplicator.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "deduplicator.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/nodes/news/deduplicator.py",
   "summary": "Node 2: News Deduplicator — 两级去重 策略： - 第一层：content_hash 精确去重（同批次内） - 第二层：标题相似度去重（简单 Jaccard 相似） 注：Embedding 语义去重（Qdrant）在 Publisher 阶段执行（需要存储后才能比对历史）。",
   "tags": [
    "langgraph",
    "node",
    "function"
   ],
   "complexity": "moderate",
   "languageNotes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "file:langgraph/nodes/news/embedding_dedup.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "embedding_dedup.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/nodes/news/embedding_dedup.py",
   "summary": "Node 2b: Embedding Deduplication — 跨批次语义去重 DLM §9 去重机制第二层：Embedding Similarity > 0.92 视为重复。 对所有进入该节点的文章执行（位于 classifier 之前，尚无 tier 信息）。 位置：deduplicator（Hash 去重）之后、classifier 之前。 失败不阻塞：如果 Qdrant/Embedd",
   "tags": [
    "langgraph",
    "node",
    "function"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "file:langgraph/nodes/news/entity.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "entity.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/nodes/news/entity.py",
   "summary": "Node 4a: News Entity Extractor — 新闻实体识别 职责： - 从分类后的文章中提取金融实体 - 实体类型引用 ontology.yaml 10 种 Entity Types - 并发处理多篇文章（Semaphore 限流） - 同时提取实体间关系 使用 prompts/news/entity_extraction.md 模板。",
   "tags": [
    "langgraph",
    "node",
    "function"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "file:langgraph/nodes/news/event.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "event.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/nodes/news/event.py",
   "summary": "Node 4b: News Event Extractor — 新闻事件抽取 职责： - 从分类后的文章中提取结构化事件 - 事件类型引用 ontology.yaml 9 种 Event Types - 评估事件影响方向（positive/negative/neutral） - 并发处理（与 Entity Extractor 并行执行） 使用 prompts/news/event_extracti",
   "tags": [
    "langgraph",
    "node",
    "function"
   ],
   "complexity": "moderate",
   "languageNotes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "file:langgraph/nodes/news/impact.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "impact.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/nodes/news/impact.py",
   "summary": "Node 5: News Impact Analyzer — 投资影响分析 职责： - 综合实体 + 事件信息，评估投资影响 - 对高重要性文章（importance >= 0.7）进行深度影响分析 - 输出结构化的影响评估（影响方向、程度、时间范围、受益/受损标的） 使用 prompts/news/impact_analysis.md 模板。 Fan-in 节点：等待 Entity Extrac",
   "tags": [
    "langgraph",
    "node",
    "function"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": ""
  },
